{"unit_id":"LotusPrimeUmbra__dsh-plugin-tts#card-zh","repo":"LotusPrimeUmbra/dsh-plugin-tts","commit":"ca2513f31603a15556f14fc2fc309fe1c3166209","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-plugin-tts** 是面向 DSH 网页端的语音合成插件，提供 MiMo 与 Breeze 两种协议的 TTS，并在设置页配置模型、音色和参考音频。它注册 `tts_speak` 与 `tts_voices` 工具：可按风格和音色合成语音、试听结果，也可通过 OneBot 将语音发送到 QQ 群或好友。插件还支持音色设计、克隆、唱歌及音量处理，适合需要在 DSH 对话中听取回复或发送 QQ 语音的用户。使用前需配置所选上游的 API Key；发送 QQ 语音还需配置 OneBot HTTP 网关。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-44","lib/tools.js:75-119"]}
{"unit_id":"LotusPrimeUmbra__dsh-plugin-tts#card-en","repo":"LotusPrimeUmbra/dsh-plugin-tts","commit":"ca2513f31603a15556f14fc2fc309fe1c3166209","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-plugin-tts** adds MiMo and Breeze speech synthesis to DSH. Use `tts_speak` to preview generated audio or send it to QQ through OneBot; `tts_voices` lists available voices. The web panel configures models and voices. A provider API key is needed, and QQ sending requires a OneBot HTTP gateway.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:21-44","lib/tools.js:75-119"]}
